sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant H as Handler
    participant S as URL Service
    participant R as Redis
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant A as Analytics Worker

    C->>H: GET /{code}
    H->>S: ResolveURL(code)

    S->>R: GET url:{code}

    alt Cache hit
        R-->>S: URL cache entry
        S->>S: Check expires_at
    else Cache miss
        R-->>S: Not found

        S->>DB: Lookup custom alias

        alt Alias found
            DB-->>S: URL
        else Alias not found
            S->>S: Base62 decode code
            S->>DB: Lookup by ID
            DB-->>S: URL
        end

        S->>R: SET url:{code}
    end

    S->>A: Emit redirect event
    S-->>H: Original URL
    H-->>C: 302 Redirect